      \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d9e5/544d/330204_normal.png?m=1711431966\" alt=\"allinQQQ\" data-uid=\"330204\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/allinQQQ\">allinQQQ</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 09:24:46 +08:00\">22h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>bot 使用体验如何，和 muse 比起来？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18172714\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/466a/a2a5/657384_normal.png?m=1730862016\" alt=\"zhonghao01\" data-uid=\"657384\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhonghao01\">zhonghao01</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 09:40:08 +08:00\">21h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以前订阅的 super grok 还是只能在 grok build 里用吗？按照它这个旧版的 tag 来讲</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18172879\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3e3c/e945/103608_normal.png?m=1747034630\" alt=\"bghtyu\" data-uid=\"103608\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bghtyu\">bghtyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 09:58:15 +08:00\">21h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Grok bot 还不错，权限限制很少，默认是有 root 权限的，道德水准也比较低。<br>Open AI dots 的云电脑权限卡的很死，没有 root ，不能用 apt 装包，终端执行命令还有可能被它的自动审批拒绝执行，且无法关闭审批。GUI 的终端居然没有网络权限，就离谱。<br>相比之下 Grok bot 啥都不管，还是挺不错的，就是没有 dot 聪明，毕竟 dot 是 Astra 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18172953\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4a75/d6bc/176338_normal.png?m=1749552715\" alt=\"shuang\" data-uid=\"176338\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shuang\">shuang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 10:05:55 +08:00\">21h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直用的 cursor pro ，包含 auto 、other 、grok bot ，单独的池，性价比非常高，<br>新的额度不知道怎么样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18172955\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7b45/8405/220936_normal.png?m=1727574219\" alt=\"lear7\" data-uid=\"220936\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lear7\">lear7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 10:06:13 +08:00\">21h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>目前 Cursor 20 刀计划，不太想升级，新计划没有第三方模型额度了，想应急用用都不行。Grok 家的模型还差点火候。</p><p>BTW ，Grok Bot 很好用，用了就离不开了，我 Hermes 都卸载了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18173079\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e72f/93ee/237505_normal.png?m=1785372754\" alt=\"licoycn\" data-uid=\"237505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/licoycn\">licoycn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 10:17:29 +08:00\">21h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/dododook\">dododook</a> 老套餐还是分开的，新订阅的才是共享的，所以老套餐我感觉保值，特别是 hevay 赠送的 cursor ，还有额外的 other models ，新的官方介绍不包含了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18173100\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dbf0/f1ab/504831_normal.png?m=1777999188\" alt=\"AEDaydreamer\" data-uid=\"504831\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AEDaydreamer\">AEDaydreamer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 10:19:24 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在 grok 除了 bot 其他都是篮子, 我宁愿单出买 bot 的 plan.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18173101\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4324/ec1f/574804_normal.png?m=1791854032\" alt=\"Vaspike\" data-uid=\"574804\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Vaspike\">Vaspike</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-13 10:19:27 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/allinQQQ\">allinQQQ</a> bot 好用的, bot 里的模型也有人说是 claude 的 opus, 真假就不清楚了, 我用不出来</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18173109\">\n        